# Prospective macro collect-due. Replace /path/to/forex-bot.
# Cron does not start in the repository directory; the wrapper cds there.
# Interval: every 5 minutes. Late wakes still use current UTC; the application
# does not backdate missed checkpoints.
*/5 * * * * /path/to/forex-bot/scripts/run_macro_prospective_collect_due.sh
